line-flex tw-items-center tw-rounded-sm tw-border-100 tw-border-ink-common-deep-blue tw-border-opacity-0 tw-underline-offset-2 focus:tw-border-dashed focus:tw-border-opacity-100 focus:tw-text-ink-common-medium-teal focus:tw-underline focus:tw-outline-none hover:tw-text-ink-common-dark-teal hover:tw-underline" href="/listings">Listings<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right tw-ml-spacing-400 tw-size-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></li><li class="tw-my-spacing-200 tw-inline-flex tw-items-center tw-text-ink-common-deep-blue tw-font-body-xs [&amp;:nth-child(n+2):nth-last-child(n+2)]:tw-hidden first:tw-inline-flex last:tw-inline-flex sm:[&amp;:nth-child(n+2):nth-last-child(n+2)]:tw-inline-flex sm:group-has-[&gt;:nth-child(n+5)]:[&amp;:nth-child(n+3):nth-last-child(n+3)]:tw-hidden sm:[&amp;:nth-last-child(2)]:tw-inline-flex">Funds</li></ol></nav><section class="tw-relative tw-overflow-hidden tw-bg-interface-brand-deep-blue"><div class="
          tw-relative tw-mx-auto tw-flex tw-max-w-screen-xl tw-flex-col tw-justify-between
          tw-gap-spacing-500 tw-p-spacing-600
          lg:tw-py-spacing-800
          md:tw-flex-row md:tw-gap-spacing-600
        "><div><p class="!tw-mb-spacing-600 tw-uppercase tw-font-detail-md-caps tw-text-ink-brand-accent-03">Funds</p><h1 class="tw-mb-spacing-400 tw-text-ink-common-inv-01 !tw-leading-md tw-font-display-sm md:tw-font-display-md" data-heading-level="1">ETFs on TMX Australia Exchange</h1></div></div></section><section data-section-background="default" class="tw-w-full tw-transition-colors tw-bg-interface-common-base-01 [&amp;:has(+section[data-section-background=&quot;default&quot;])&gt;div]:tw-pb-spacing-600 [&amp;:has(+section[data-section-background=&quot;transparent&quot;])&gt;div]:tw-pb-spacing-800 [&amp;&gt;div&gt;p]:tw-text-ink-common-base-04 [section[data-section-background=&quot;default&quot;]+&amp;&gt;div]:tw-pt-spacing-600"><div class="tw-mx-auto tw-max-w-screen-xl tw-px-spacing-600 tw-py-spacing-800"><p>Exchange Traded Funds (ETFs) are managed investment funds that trade on TMX Australia Exchange just like ordinary shares. They offer a simple, cost-effective way to gain exposure to a wide range of asset classes, sectors, and markets - both domestic and global.</p><p>TMX Australia Exchange&#x27;s marketplace offers a diverse range of funds, including passively managed ETFs that track specific indices, actively managed ETFs, and single asset ETFs that focus on a specific commodity, currency, or crypto asset.</p><p>TMX Australia Exchange Funds trade exclusively on the TMX Australia Exchange Market and are designed to meet the needs of modern investors seeking transparency, liquidity, and innovation.</p><div role="alert" class="tw-relative tw-w-full tw-max-w-[815px] tw-rounded-md tw-p-spacing-600 [&amp;&gt;svg]:tw-absolute [&amp;&gt;svg]:tw-left-7 [&amp;&gt;svg]:tw-top-spacing-600 [&amp;&gt;svg]:tw-h-5 [&amp;&gt;svg]:tw-w-5 [&amp;&gt;svg+div]:tw-translate-y-[-3px] [&amp;&gt;svg~*]:tw-pl-7 tw-mx-auto tw-mt-spacing-600 tw-bg-interface-brand-primary-06"><div class="
